<title>USA: Unocal shuts hydrocracker at L.A. refinery.</title>
<headline>Unocal shuts hydrocracker at L.A. refinery.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unocal Corp said on Wednesday it shut a hydrocracker at its 130,000 barrel-per-day refinery near Los Angeles, Calif., but could not immediately give further details.</p>
<p>&quot;It's a hydrocracker that's down at our Wilmington plant,&quot; a company spokeswoman said, denying earlier trade rumors of a shut fluid catalytic cracker.</p>
